.TH OCR\-WARMUP 1 "2026-08-27" "ocr-tela 1.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ocr\-warmup \- preload tesseract models into the page cache
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ocr\-warmup
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads the installed tesseract language models so the first recognition of the
session does not pay for reading them from disk. It only speeds up the first
use and is safe to run at any time.
.PP
The package ships a systemd user unit,
.IR ocr\-warmup.service ,
which is installed but deliberately left disabled. Enable it if you want the
warmup to run at login:
.PP
.EX
systemctl \-\-user enable \-\-now ocr\-warmup.service
.EE
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B OCR_LANG
Language used for the warmup run, defaults to
.BR por .
.TP
.B OCR_TESSDATA
Alternative directory of models to preload as well.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ocr\-tela (1),
.BR tesseract (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Augusto Mateus
